      "created_at": "2016-01-11T15:28:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm presuming you've regularly got Ra on the team. Ra's one of the characters who can outright eliminate Plague Rat's biggest advantage (the ability to make heroes hit themselves) singlehandedly. Him plus Visionary can render him entirely impotent.</p><p>Personally I don't like fighting him much, because unless you're specifically mitigating him like that, it's a damage race in which he has a big head start.</p>",
