      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"mwc146\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n mwc146:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm presuming you've regularly got Ra on the team. Ra's one of the characters who can outright eliminate Plague Rat's biggest advantage (the ability to make heroes hit themselves) singlehandedly. Him plus Visionary can render him entirely impotent.Personally I don't like fighting him much, because unless you're specifically mitigating him like that, it's a damage race in which he has a big head start.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah I learned late that Ra + Imbued Fire + Flesh Sun God makes it completely free.</p>\n<p>But in this battle, you see it was in Pike, and both Biometrics in play. Essentially any and all damage dealt by Infections were healed. And Fixer's Crane style made me hit through defense, so…yeah.</p>\n<p>Weird cuz any other match I have on Pike ends with a lot of pain for me.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
