      "created_at": "2016-01-12T15:49:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I quite often take Jim against Rat - those two just destroy each other but more often than not I manage to take him out before he kills me...and if I don't, I've usually whittled him down enough that the other heroes can finish him off. Infection + Plague Locus + By Any Means + Ultimate Target = five points of damage every time I hit him with all my plinky attacks, which means a total of ten damage with the Compounded Bow. Twice in a round, thanks to the fact that Rat is guaranteed to hit someone on his turn ;).</p>",
